scope:
A repeat holistic Gate G architectural-clay review of the exact GLB: sha256 verified, 4,737,704 bytes, no images or textures, 31 meshes, 67,432 triangles. It was checked against the locked oblique (variant_0_angle_60.jpg) and roof view (variant_0_angle_90.jpg); variant_0.png was excluded as instructed. Every v007 finding was re-tested, and the full regression was re-run:
- the builder's 18 renders and 4 phone boards, at full resolution;
- 56 reviewer renders of the exact GLB from the supplied review page, plus two derived crops (a pinhole crop and a crop comparing the reference with the model), using the complete v007 camera roster plus new views of the upper slot windows on the west and north faces, the flight guards, the inner parapet from the stairs, the full stack, the plant louvres, the turf pad, a close summit aerial and the terrace slot, and five see-through tests against a magenta background;
- Python geometry checks: component inventory; a ray test of every slot window for visibility of its occupied plane; an overhead exposure test of every window reveal above 29 m; a continuity probe of the inner parapet face; a coplanar-overlap search; winding against stored normals; corner radius by height; stack section by height; and support contact.
This review grants no keeper, runtime or publication approval.
